WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:33.730
Negotiations have broken down!

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:35.970
Begin the attack!

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.240
I found you.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:02.350
Joey! I've been looking for you.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.850
Hey, you've forgotten me already?

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.150
It's me!

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.420
Well...

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:14.730
See, me?

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:24.240
M-Mr. Hughes?

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:29.610
I'm Agent Hughes from the NIA, and 
I report directly to the President.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:33.580
I'm the person in charge 
of this series of missions.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.170
Will you listen to what I have to say?

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.250
I can understand why you're apprehensive.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:44.900
But if you want to run away, you 
could wait until after we talk, right?

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:49.110
I'm a real sucker for coffee, see.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:00.760
Still? You still haven't found them?

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:05.540
The army is getting special reinforcements 
and searching the forest.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.250
What? Special forces?

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.090
Damn it!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:24.340
With all the big boys here, what 
do they think they're doing?

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:28.930
The Ghost is one thing, but why is it 
taking so long to find one little brat?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:33.400
We are continuing to use thermal 
sensors to perform our own search.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.900
I believe we will find them 
eventually if we stay calm...

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.240
That's not the problem!

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.750
The problem here is that we adults 
are being made fools of by a child!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:44.870
Is that so?

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.620
Yes, it is!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:51.780
I'm gonna show that brat who he's dealing with!

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.310
Is that so?

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:54.330
Yes, it is!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:04.930
It's not as good as Hilly's, but it's not bad.

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.940
Now, what should we talk about?

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.750
Did you know from the beginning?

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:13.060
I wish...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.990
If I had known, we could have 
worked something out earlier.

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:24.030
But man, what a surprise to 
learn you knew the Ghost.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.230
Ghost?

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.900
The robot.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.700
Heroman's name isn't Ghost!

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.550
Oh, so you call it Heroman?

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.060
So then, where is he now?

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:44.060
What's the relationship between you 
and that robot... I mean, Heroman?

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.350
Fine, then I'll go first.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.020
I received command of this 
operation two weeks ago.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:58.060
We got a shot of Heroman from a 
security camera at one of the scenes.

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:04.140
In order to find out its identity, 
I came to Center City.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:11.350
Our mission is to confirm or deny the 
existence of hyper-advanced technology,

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.590
as well as secure it.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.500
The government is scared.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.130
Of your power, that is.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.880
It's to be expected.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.940
Someone destroyed the Skrugg,

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:27.640
who the entire might of the United 
States military wasn't able to scratch.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.940
And their identity is still a mystery.

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:31.320
Well, that's...

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:34.020
But I was thinking of doing something 
like this from the start.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.770
I'd like to talk with the Ghost.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.860
I mean, think about it!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:45.800
Somebody that wanted to conquer the world 
isn't going to help the city rebuild.

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:49.670
Plus, all the people at the construction 
sites said the same thing:

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:53.370
That you guys are allies of justice.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.450
Everyone said that about Heroman?

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:57.430
Yup.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.490
I'm convinced now.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:09.350
A person who can smile like you can't be evil.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.550
Mr. Hughes...

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.420
Would you tell me?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:17.480
Joey?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.060
About everything.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.030
Keep the altitude lower!

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:32.840
Please, don't ask the impossible!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.970
You know what'll happen if 
we drop any lower, right?

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:39.610
So you wanna get picked up on the military's 
radar and taken to the woodshed?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.650
This is the place, right?

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.880
Stay calm, it'll be fine. My info is right.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.030
I sure hope it is.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.000
Don't underestimate the power of the press.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:55.400
It doesn't matter how much they try and keep 
people silent, the info always leaks out!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.250
A government plot...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:03.010
And behind it all is Dr. Minami with his deep 
connections to higher-ups in the military.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.570
We know who's behind it, so if we can bring 
it to light, this'll be a big scandal!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:11.780
All that's left is to pile on 
the pressure to broadcast it.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.580
And that's exactly why we're here!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.660
Wait a second, that's...

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.570
That's...

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:28.890
It's huge!

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:33.690
Hey!

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:34.810
Turn back at once!

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:36.100
I'm not paid enough for this!

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:39.290
I said turn back!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.730
Point 302, no sign of the target.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.430
Point 257, no sign of the target.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.730
I see. So it really was you 
who defeated the Skrugg.

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:58.460
Yes. We were just trying to survive...

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:04.680
It seems we've been trying to get 
rid of the saviors of the world.

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:07.450
Why do you think it came to this?

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.240
I apologize. I take full responsibility.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:16.640
If I had been able to speak with you 
first, this would never have happened.

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.100
Mr. Hughes!

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:25.190
We have a reaction from the thermal sensor.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.530
Is it the Ghost?

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:32.270
It does not seem to be the Ghost. We 
have confirmed a boy and Agent Hughes.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:33.900
What?

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:37.790
What the hell is he doing?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.120
Um...

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.590
What's going to happen now?

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.840
You'll be taken for observation,

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:50.090
and be subject to intense government 
experiments for the rest of your life in captivity.

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:54.710
Is that what you thought?

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:00.710
The power that destroyed the Skrugg 
is definitely something special.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:02.580
But turning the tables

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:09.010
and using force to oppress someone with 
power greater than ours isn't right.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:15.840
First we need to decide on a way we can 
cooperate instead of being enemies.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.390
That's how I feel.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.490
Um, then...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.110
That's a promise. I report directly to the 
President of the United States, after all.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.460
Mr. Hughes!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.870
You think I'll let you do that?

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.830
First, let's end all this.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.080
After that we can talk at leisure.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.620
Doctor, your orders?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.640
Block his communications, obviously!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.640
Roger.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.270
Mr. Hughes!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:26.410
Attention all forces! The target 
has been spotted at point 451!

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.530
Commence attack at once!

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.970
Dr. Minami!

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:35.380
This NIA agent is cooperating with the target!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:39.610
He's a traitor to the United States, 
and is colluding with the Ghost!

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:42.070
Eliminate him together with the Ghost!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:48.370
It is with regret that I now assume 
command of this operation from the NIA.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:50.140
However!

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.900
I expect you all to deeply impress me!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:56.470
This battle will determine 
the fate of the entire world!

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.930
You must completely destroy the target!

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:03.410
I repeat: You must destroy the target!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.390
W-What's going on?

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.630
As you can tell, I've been set up.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.400
For the time being, let's get away from here!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.390
Beginning attack toward target!

00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:19.760
Set up?

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.370
An evil man who has wheedled 
his way into the government

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:25.700
is trying to crush our peaceful negotiations!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:30.410
It's the doings of a man who knows 
how to deal with the military.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.370
Then what about your promise?

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:34.540
Deal's off.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.130
If I'm dead, that is.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:46.220
But if I can get word through the appropriate 
channels, we can counter his plan.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:52.890
Well, that's why he's trying to silence me 
before I get a chance to get the word out.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.550
Um, I don't really understand.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:03.740
Basically, I can't die just yet.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.780
So, would you like to help me with that?

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:11.290
I need your cooperation.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:19.330
Now, hurry and show yourself, Ghost!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:21.340
Heroman...

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:23.800
Engage!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.810
Target confirmed. It is the Ghost.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.360
There it is!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.460
I'm counting on you, Joey!

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.800
Heroman!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.140
Heroman!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.490
What happened?

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.530
No damage?

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:29.030
If we can stop them here...

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.220
We're going to split up now.

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:35.870
I'm going to find a way to send a message.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.430
Until then, I need you to keep their attention.

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.920
Okay! I understand.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.430
Don't die on me.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.630
Mr. Hughes!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.380
Yeah, thanks.

00:13:55.900 --> 00:14:00.100
If we can stop them here, then 
we won't have to run anymore!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:06.910
Perfect, perfect! This is 
all going according to plan!

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.370
Amanorich and Stallion are 
at the scheduled location.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.180
Are they?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.860
Seems we're also right where we should be.

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:21.450
First, we let the Ghost's combat ability 
be made clear during the military's attack.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:32.010
Then after they've had quite 
enough of the Ghost's power,

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.670
I take the Ghost and crush it with my robot!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.960
Start up the electromagnetic pulse cannon!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.440
Yes, sir!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.420
Stallion!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:42.670
Leave this to me!

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:54.730
Damn it! Our attacks are completely ineffective!

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:57.410
Don't we have any stronger weapons?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.310
What was that?

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.490
What was that just now?

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:04.500
Who fired?

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.400
Let me introduce you!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.470
<i>This</i> is art in movement!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:38.410
I, Dr. Minami, have invented the strongest,
ultimate weapon in the entire universe!

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:42.620
MR-1!

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.540
MR-1?

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.920
Now, let's begin Ghost! You minion of evil!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:53.440
I'll make sure you taste 
the wrath of justice!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.230
Take this!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:05.600
E!! M!! P!!

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:27.590
I know! I know!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.580
I know your weakness!

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:33.670
No need to pay that high tuition!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:37.680
I took data during our last battle!

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:41.320
Incredible defensive ability.

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:44.500
And even more incredible battle strength!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:52.030
It wouldn't be overstating it to say that you 
could defeat any weapon on this planet easily!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:53.960
However!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:58.280
You have a crucial weakness!

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:00.760
And that is...

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:05.660
You're not equipped with 
any long range weaponry!

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:16.760
As long as I stay outside of your attack 
range, there's nothing to worry about!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:27.570
Hey, what's that light?

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:30.040
Does anyone have any information?

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:41.490
What's the matter? Feeling glum, Ghost?

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:46.410
Nothing is going to be settled at this rate.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:49.460
I've got to find some way 
to get close to that robot.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.800
And in order to do that, I have 
to do something about that weapon.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:15.900
Finally noticed?

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:21.410
This fearsome weapon is a indeed an 
electromagnetic pulse generator!

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.210
Electromagnetic pulse?

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.880
Listen up, boy!

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:30.630
I, Dr. Minami, will lecture you uneducated fool!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:34.420
This electromagnetic pulse generator

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:38.260
was developed from a system that spreads out 
electromagnetic waves over a large area,

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:44.380
into a weapon that uses semiconductors 
and electricity for complete destruction!

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.680
Electromagnetic waves?

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:50.340
Even if it is hyper-advanced technology, 
the Ghost is still a machine!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.370
One hit with this and it'll be all over!

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:58.090
Oh, really?

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:00.980
Whatever, just set up the relay!

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:03.760
This is an exclusive! A total scoop!

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:07.210
It's meaningless unless we do it live!

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:11.880
Give me a break! No edits, no way, no how!

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:14.500
Yeah, none of the other media have noticed yet.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.640
This is the scoop of the century!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.760
I don't really mind either way...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.550
But it's already started.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:29.210
Hey, if you noticed then say something!

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.800
Y-Yeah...

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.460
Leo, you ready?

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.850
Okay! All set!

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:35.940
Hurry and connect the relay!

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.550
We're heading to the scene!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:38.790
<i>Hey, Keisha, wait!</i>

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.490
Go, please!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.690
Roger!

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:46.910
Heroman!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:51.870
Child's play.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:55.010
Then how about this?

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.030
Heroman!

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:10.290
I've been waiting for this!

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.810
It's over!

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:18.980
Heroman!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.360
What?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.910
So you've figured out we can't 
fire in quick succession?

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.780
Rapid charge!

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:34.660
That's crazy!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:38.130
Impossible. Doing that would cause 
the machine to become immobile.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:44.190
Then how about this?

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:48.300
Fire!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.520
Heroman!

00:20:57.890 --> 00:21:00.120
Why, you...

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.670
Heroman...

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:11.910
That's enough!

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:15.790
Attention all forces! Halt hostilities at once!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:20.370
That's an order from the President 
of the United States of America!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:23.300
I repeat: End the battle!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.910
Mr. Hughes!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:28.970
Sorry I took so long, Joey.

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:31.660
This battle is over!

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:36.260
Dr. Minami, surrender at once!

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:38.670
This battle ends now!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.280
Hughes...

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:45.110
Fine, I get it. Just like you asked...

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:48.980
I'll end this battle now!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:09.130
Heroman!

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:32.400
<b>I want to get to know you better,</b>

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.490
<b>to go at each other with our true feelings.</b>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.830
<b>Your tears and smile are both here.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.260
<b>No matter how hard it is, I won't be scared any more.</b>

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.320
<b>With both of us, we can go anywhere.</b>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:54.760
<b>Since you're the one who taught me that I'm not alone.</b>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.450
<b>Every time I mutter the words "I was born to meet you"</b>

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:07.490
<b>my unease disappears, and my heart burns stronger.</b>

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:14.440
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:19.300
<b>Carve out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.840
<b>I can't move away from here.</b>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Because I live feeling the same heartbeat.</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>I want to protect you to the very last,</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>to protect the promise built up.</b>

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.810
<b>We are carving out this irreplaceable time!</b>

